    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000tm8h](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000tm8h) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Aug 20 2026 34km NE of Mbay. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -8.2877 longitude 121.3981. It impacted 177403 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
